---
/**
 * Inline keyboard-key label. Used both as an explicit `<Kbd>` tag and mapped
 * from the markdown `kbd` element. Reads as a physical key via the same
 * panel + ring treatment `.prose code` uses — no border.
 */
---

<kbd class="kbd"><slot /></kbd>

<style>
  .kbd {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.15em 0.45em;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    background: var(--panel);
    border-radius: 4px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-ring);
    vertical-align: baseline;
  }
</style>
